'''Burning Orbs''' are objects that appear during the fight with [[Akkha]] in the [[Tombs of Amascut]], where they appear if he unleashes his Trailing Orbs attack, and the player moves whilst in the north-west quadrant. If players walk into one, it will inflict a burn that periodically deals 5 damage for several hits, and can spread to unaffected players if next to them.

